{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":66103,\"title\":\"Ace Attorney\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A rookie lawyer Ryuuichi Naruhodou stands up to save his defendants by proving their innocence from unusual cases! Is the defendant guilty or innocent...? Believing his client's innocence Naruhodou stands in court and battles his rival judges. With the word of \\\"OBJECTION!\\\" and limited evidence, Naruhodou makes a comeback when all odds are against him and seems like there is nothing more he can do. Don't miss out on the comical episodes between him and his mentor Chihiro Ayasato, assistant Mayoi Ayasato, rival prosecutor Reiji Mitsurugi, and numerous unique characters! The anime also depicts the childhood relationship between Naruhodou and his friends. With the skills inherited from his mentor Naruho reveals the truth!\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Rfcx9QxZqvsEl1Kh7yFhPpzb9R.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h4ubSg0Ipr8Nggo2SH83c3wuJI0.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":37,\"year\":2016,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":47,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"YTV\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2019-03-30\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2376290,\"name\":\"Shigeru Fukase\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1498113,\"name\":\"Ayako Kono\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6WFOZlfnN0F4X9FcGJ5tOy6wU4X.jpg\"},{\"id\":2387138,\"name\":\"Shinichirou Ueda\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2376286,\"name\":\"Yukiko Imai\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2099602,\"name\":\"Shingo Kaneko\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1923814,\"name\":\"Kazuki Ohashi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2376291,\"name\":\"Yusuke Maruyama\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2376067,\"name\":\"Takudai Kakuchi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1693097,\"name\":\"Yoshihide Ibata\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2376285,\"name\":\"Yoshiko Mikami\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1375830,\"name\":\"Yorifusa Yamaguchi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1793493,\"name\":\"Nanako Shimazaki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2171390,\"name\":\"Takaaki Wada\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1309258,\"name\":\"Takaharu Ozaki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1SZhEOeg7oZ90HI1zYBTC99QWN.jpg\"},{\"id\":2307839,\"name\":\"Kenji Takahashi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ikyp6vxu0611V2D0xuBmnKihRTm.jpg\"},{\"id\":2376301,\"name\":\"Kakushi Ifuku\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1780655,\"name\":\"Erika Okamoto\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2376288,\"name\":\"Kosaya\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2376287,\"name\":\"Kiyomitsu Sato\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2178842,\"name\":\"Shingo Uchida\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2376303,\"name\":\"Naoki Murata\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1536166,\"name\":\"Satoshi Saga\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/omru7nepHVakKdIHIzoGSDVN7GX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1524348,\"name\":\"Tomio Yamauchi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2376302,\"name\":\"Masatoyo Takada\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":16136,\"name\":\"Hiroyuki Kitakubo\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3x10t53CY9z5XODAUA8Ifp2t2NX.jpg\"},{\"id\":2376289,\"name\":\"Naoki Hishikawa\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8V6d7qhJFffvd3CwDiFMl8R7saD.jpg\"},{\"id\":149894,\"name\":\"Yuki Kaji\",\"character\":\"Ryuuichi Naruhodou (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8wKdPV11IwowfwoqGqMMNt9hmp6.jpg\"},{\"id\":936275,\"name\":\"Aoi Yuki\",\"character\":\"Mayoi Ayasato (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg\"},{\"id\":1695521,\"name\":\"Masashi Tamaki\",\"character\":\"Reiji Mitsurugi (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qjRO6XFM1vArAfbW8De2CfEzLPu.jpg\"},{\"id\":1247703,\"name\":\"Saori Yumiba\",\"character\":\"Mei Karuma (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gBf9qGNY3DV4012goVsm61ETeMr.jpg\"},{\"id\":40451,\"name\":\"Akio Otsuka\",\"character\":\"Gou Karuma (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uH9oiqOOgrsz2zNnouVZ1qPzDyb.jpg\"},{\"id\":227616,\"name\":\"Ben Hiura\",\"character\":\"Judge (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mSJZsPtZvKcek4vnejdhdnEmFPx.jpg\"},{\"id\":82057,\"name\":\"Chie Nakamura\",\"character\":\"Chihiro Ayasato (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/evB6vKUbm0CKgBcgikPeFXdwd29.jpg\"},{\"id\":225656,\"name\":\"Masami Iwasaki\",\"character\":\"Keisuke Itonokogiri (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oPbAnYT409Ng3zkULTz0FewK6Es.jpg\"},{\"id\":1251423,\"name\":\"Toru Nara\",\"character\":\"Masashi Yahari (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rrfvhZpmGsgGxmBSo7SJ6rUfuXP.jpg\"},{\"id\":84505,\"name\":\"Hiroaki Hirata\",\"character\":\"Godot (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mMWEdlssJm3TVuXW4Wb7pQeX20Z.jpg\"},{\"id\":1241566,\"name\":\"Rina Sato\",\"character\":\"Ayame / Chinami Miyanagi (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kk0Tir25lDqdqYHHnYCpknGgZCa.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"Jt-nbWhlVF4\",\"name\":\"Ace Attorney Season One Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":312474,\"title\":\"NIPPON SANGOKU: The Three Nations of the Crimson Sun\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sM7zYE6xOmaNwC28LR7cEneAtuN.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21043478260869566,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"A second season adapts the 3rd game in franchise, Trials and Tribulations, as well as \\\"Lost Turnabout\\\", the only case from the second game that was not adapted in the first season.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gQ0f4BqlzUZbimVXRok3s37GPGD.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2018-10-06\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The Lost Turnabout\",\"overview\":\"Phoenix suffers a blow to the head from behind and loses his memory right before a trial, in which he is defending police officer Maggey Byrde for the murder of her boyfriend and fellow officer Dustin Prince.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g6mufwKFe0HL0Km7yqkURZMVdrQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-06\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Stolen Turnabout – 1st Trial\",\"overview\":\"When the Kurain Village's sacred urn is stolen from an exhibit at the Lordly Tailor by the mysterious thief Mask DeMasque, Phoenix, Maya, and Pearl investigate the scene and meet self-proclaimed ace detective Luke Atmey.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sseSCGvDwiYjHSJUR0GEYPtLiYe.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-13\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Stolen Turnabout – 2nd Trial\",\"overview\":\"As Phoenix struggles to make a case that Ron wasn't the one who stole the urn, Maya brings in Larry, who was working as a security guard for the exhibition.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mbMLjeJBevn6KcHIUWBUoTIymjL.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-20\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Stolen Turnabout – 3rd Trial\",\"overview\":\"After Phoenix and Maya notice that her urn has been covered in splotches and returned to its original shape, Adrian reveals she accidentally broke and tried to cover it up by moving a statue, which was in different position to when Phoenix first found it.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pyVwNOBysdoMCTnNLU51CuNKgKB.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-27\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Stolen Turnabout – Last Trial\",\"overview\":\"Godot begins the trial by stating that the CEO fired Ron for stealing confidential data and was blackmailing him in exchange for not telling Desirée.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wqD1amnvCOx6q0F7XbkYASZzfGJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-03\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Sound the Turnabout Melody\",\"overview\":\"Phoenix thinks back to his middle school days, three years after Edgeworth lost his father and began living with von Karma and Franziska.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mBBKSQyU6CO83qVC7cuRh954HPB.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-10\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Recipe for Turnabout – 1st Trial\",\"overview\":\"Phoenix is surprised to hear that Maggey was found guilty in a murder trial that he himself was reportedly the defense attorney for.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5MRUZIbgMvtSrvwAjeGq7Pu7YVo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-17\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Recipe for Turnabout – 2nd Trial\",\"overview\":\"Resuming their investigation at Trés Bien, Phoenix and Maya learn that Armstrong owes money to a loan shark. After getting more details from Kido, Phoenix and Maya visit the office of the loan shark in question and the one who impersonated Phoenix, Furio Tigre.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8lA3drAy2kEt9abMdS55awniTmX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-24\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Recipe for Turnabout – Last Trial\",\"overview\":\"Following a hole-filled testimony by Armstrong, Phoenix suspects that the murder Kido witnessed was actually a reenactment which took place after the actual murder.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gKnNbaHzfXZi7LyN9NjOkkBKxXt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-01\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Northward, Turnabout Express – 1st Trial\",\"overview\":\"On New Year's Eve, Phoenix and Maya, along with Gumshoe and the judge, are invited by Avery Richman to ride the maiden voyage of the Silver Star express train.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5e303fBVIbc9CGjZ9YWhigeEG28.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-08\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Northward, Turnabout Express – 2nd Trial\",\"overview\":\"The details of Richman's original trial state that a secretary-general named Benjamin Cashanova was shot during a year-end ceremony, with Richman found with a pistol in the direction the gunshot came from.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AmT7d6Mu4ys4SZzbtTSbiwvi89w.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-15\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Northward, Turnabout Express – Last Trial\",\"overview\":\"Gumshoe reports about Gale's corpse and the \\\"soul\\\" he saw, which Phoenix reveals was a brief fire that he saw, as the train's cars were actually rearranged just before the takeover.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AmT7d6Mu4ys4SZzbtTSbiwvi89w.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-22\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Turnabout Memories\",\"overview\":\"Five years ago, Phoenix is accused for the murder of Doug Swallow, who was electrocuted to death. Mia, who had previously been traumatized by her first trial a year ago, defends Phoenix in court, where Payne suggests Phoenix had bad blood with Swallow over his then girlfriend Dahlia Hawthorne and pushed him into a severed electrical cable.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kfHXRym3HC2EFXtvMdZrMGrkhSQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-19\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Hear the Waves of Turnabout\",\"overview\":\"After accidentally breaking a precious seashell that she received from Maya, Pearl asks Phoenix to help her search for an identical looking shell without Maya knowing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9wqqRbBbIuJmcmtrpdaSjXQyxds.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-26\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Turnabout Beginnings – 1st Trial\",\"overview\":\"One year prior to her first meeting with Phoenix, Mia takes on her first client; a death row convict named Terry Fawles who is accused of murdering policewoman Valerie Hawthorne, with the assistance of her senior, Diego Armando.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3mujanF4syqXlKE6rI7WNfh3L2N.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-02\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Turnabout Beginnings – Last Trial\",\"overview\":\"After Dahlia's attempt to feign ignorance only incriminates her further, Mia has Fawles testify about the incident from five years ago.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2b1WQb6vGQliPffnrHEQKTsPqon.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-09\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Bridge to the Turnabout - 1st Trial\",\"overview\":\"Phoenix, Maya, and Pearl go to Hazakura Temple for Maya's training, where they meet children's book author Elise Deauxnim and nuns Bikini and Iris, along with Larry, who is studying as Elise's apprentice.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dlxSvcvu7PswO2mMboMkotuiTQ0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-16\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Bridge to the Turnabout - 2nd Trial\",\"overview\":\"While investigating the shrine, Edgeworth listens to Bikini's account of Elise's murder, learning that Pearl has gone missing, before meeting up with Larry, who appears to be hiding something he saw on the night.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iqb9h4twsrvIMetYJWaAuurFnFF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-23\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Bridge to the Turnabout - 3rd Trial\",\"overview\":\"During his testimony, Larry presents a sketch he drew of what he saw on the night of the murder, allegedly depicting Iris flying over the flaming bridge.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2zB2zlc1HVc10Ni63Fq7v1yRv08.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-02\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Bridge to the Turnabout - 4th Trial\",\"overview\":\"While Iris is brought in to work on the trick lock, Phoenix finds a charred letter instructing someone to channel someone, along with a talisman Elise was carrying.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6113MEDzgEzmilnEkgTtRCHBwtq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-09\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Bridge to the Turnabout - 5th Trial\",\"overview\":\"As court resumes with Phoenix once again against Godot, Iris suddenly claims that she helped cover up Elise's murder after she was allegedly killed by Maya in self-defense. However, her testimony proves false with the reveal of real murder weapon and Elise's identity as Misty.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jcbv3pTf7ghf0rC7JwdZbnvUE8K.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-16\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Bridge to the Turnabout - 6th Trial\",\"overview\":\"Dahlia reveals she had plotted with Morgan to murder Maya and make Pearl head of the Kurain family so she could get revenge against Mia.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rxpmMm9SirTBrMImIEoyadup038.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-23\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Bridge to the Turnabout - Last Trial\",\"overview\":\"Noticing that Maya was able to identify the true culprit in the dark, Phoenix deduces that the killer is Godot, whose red visor not only glows in the dark but also leaves him unable to see anything red, including the bloody message incriminating Maya.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kfu7RsEelWDJYEOGq9iUZuL0QBg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-30\",\"runtime\":25}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2016-04-02\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}